# PC/AT 8x8 font of the system BIOS, codes 00h-7Fh.
#
# The glyphs reproduce the original AMI system BIOS typeface, see utils/LEGAL_FONT.md.
# The MIT-0 licence of utils/bios_at/LICENSE grants no rights in the typeface.
#
# ENCODING: the character code as a decimal number.
